      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"Louie, Go Home\" is a song written by Paul Revere and Mark Lindsay as a sequel to \"Louie Louie\" by Richard Berry. It was recorded by Paul Revere and the Raiders in 1963 and released in March 1964.",
